				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Creates one note from Markdown with Notes' own importer, in the iCloud default folder. Input: JSON {operation: create-markdown, text}. No search, edits, deletion, shell scripts, network or arbitrary action execution. The MCP finds the new note among notes added to the default folder and verifies it by exact-ID readback.</string>
